{"seq":3,"slug":"channels","title":"通道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/coroutines/channels","wordCount":696,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"通道\">通道</h1><p>通道（Channel）是协程之间通信的核心原语，提供了类似阻塞队列的语义，但以挂起代替阻塞。通道实现了生产者-消费者模式，是协程间安全传递数据的首选方式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>通道的核心是<strong>以挂起代替阻塞的队列</strong>：<code>send</code> 与 <code>receive</code> 都是挂起操作，在容量耗尽或为空时挂起而非占用线程，从而在协程之间安全传递数据。它实现生产者-消费者模式；扇出（多消费者分担）、扇入（多生产者汇聚）与管道都是在这一对原语之上的组合。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"channel-基础\">Channel 基础</h2><p>Channel 提供 <code>send</code> 和 <code>receive</code> 两个挂起操作：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"import kotlinx.coroutines.*&#10;import kotlinx.coroutines.channels.*&#10;&#10;fun main() = runBlocking {&#10;    val channel = Channel&lt;Int&gt;()&#10;&#10;    launch {&#10;        for (x in 1..5) {&#10;            channel.send(x * x)&#10;            println(&quot;发送: ${x * x}&quot;)&#10;        }&#10;        channel.close()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    for (value in channel) {&#10;        println(&quot;接收: $value&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import kotlinx.coroutines.*</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import kotlinx.coroutines.channels.*</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun main() = runBlocking {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val channel = Channel&#x3C;Int>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        for (x in 1..5) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            channel.send(x * x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            println(\"发送: ${x * x}\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        channel.close()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for (value in channel) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println(\"接收: $value\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 生产者完成后应调用 <code>channel.close()</code>，消费者可以通过 <code>for</code> 循环迭代已关闭的通道。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"channel-类型\">Channel 类型</h2><p>Kotlin 提供四种缓冲策略的 Channel：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>容量</th>\n<th>send 行为</th>\n<th>receive 行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Rendezvous</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>挂起直到有接收者</td>\n<td>挂起直到有发送者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Buffered</td>\n<td>固定值 N</td>\n<td>缓冲满时挂起</td>\n<td>缓冲空时挂起</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Conflated</td>\n<td>1（覆盖）</td>\n<td>不挂起，覆盖旧值</td>\n<td>只取最新值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Unlimited</td>\n<td>无限</td>\n<td>不挂起（可能 OOM）</td>\n<td>无数据时挂起</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val rendezvous = Channel&lt;Int&gt;()                         // Rendezvous&#10;val buffered = Channel&lt;Int&gt;(capacity = 10)              // Buffered&#10;val conflated = Channel&lt;Int&gt;(Channel.CONFLATED)         // Conflated&#10;val unlimited = Channel&lt;Int&gt;(Channel.UNLIMITED)         // Unlimited\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val rendezvous = Channel&#x3C;Int>()                         // Rendezvous</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val buffered = Channel&#x3C;Int>(capacity = 10)              // Buffered</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val conflated = Channel&#x3C;Int>(Channel.CONFLATED)         // Conflated</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val unlimited = Channel&#x3C;Int>(Channel.UNLIMITED)         // Unlimited</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph &quot;Rendezvous 容量=0&quot;&#10;        A1[send 挂起] &lt;--&gt;|握手| B1[receive 挂起]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;Buffered 容量=N&quot;&#10;        A2[send] --&gt; C2[缓冲区]&#10;        C2 --&gt; B2[receive]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph &quot;Conflated 覆盖&quot;&#10;        A3[send 新值] --&gt;|覆盖| C3[仅保留最新]&#10;        C3 --&gt; B3[receive]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph \"Rendezvous 容量=0\"\n        A1[send 挂起] &lt;--&gt;|握手| B1[receive 挂起]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"Buffered 容量=N\"\n        A2[send] --&gt; C2[缓冲区]\n        C2 --&gt; B2[receive]\n    end\n\n    subgraph \"Conflated 覆盖\"\n        A3[send 新值] --&gt;|覆盖| C3[仅保留最新]\n        C3 --&gt; B3[receive]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"produce-构建器\">produce 构建器</h2><p><code>produce</code> 是创建生产者协程的便捷方式，它自动管理通道的关闭：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"fun CoroutineScope.generateNumbers(): ReceiveChannel&lt;Int&gt; = produce {&#10;    var n = 1&#10;    while (true) {&#10;        send(n++)&#10;        delay(100)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;fun main() = runBlocking {&#10;    val numbers = generateNumbers()&#10;    repeat(5) {&#10;        println(numbers.receive())&#10;    }&#10;    numbers.cancel()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fun CoroutineScope.generateNumbers(): ReceiveChannel&#x3C;Int> = produce {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var n = 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    while (true) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        send(n++)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        delay(100)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun main() = runBlocking {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val numbers = generateNumbers()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    repeat(5) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println(numbers.receive())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    numbers.cancel()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"fan-out-扇出\">Fan-Out（扇出）</h2><p>多个协程从同一个通道接收数据，实现负载均衡：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"fun main() = runBlocking {&#10;    val channel = produce {&#10;        repeat(10) {&#10;            send(it)&#10;            delay(50)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    repeat(3) { workerId -&gt;&#10;        launch {&#10;            for (msg in channel) {&#10;                println(&quot;Worker $workerId 处理: $msg&quot;)&#10;                delay(150)&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fun main() = runBlocking {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val channel = produce {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        repeat(10) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            send(it)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            delay(50)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    repeat(3) { workerId -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            for (msg in channel) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                println(\"Worker $workerId 处理: $msg\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                delay(150)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    P[Producer] --&gt; CH[Channel]&#10;    CH --&gt; W1[Worker 1]&#10;    CH --&gt; W2[Worker 2]&#10;    CH --&gt; W3[Worker 3]\">flowchart LR\n    P[Producer] --&gt; CH[Channel]\n    CH --&gt; W1[Worker 1]\n    CH --&gt; W2[Worker 2]\n    CH --&gt; W3[Worker 3]</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Fan-Out 模式下，每条消息只会被一个消费者接收，实现自动的任务分发。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"fan-in-扇入\">Fan-In（扇入）</h2><p>多个协程向同一个通道发送数据：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"suspend fun produceMessages(channel: SendChannel&lt;String&gt;, id: String, count: Int) {&#10;    repeat(count) {&#10;        channel.send(&quot;来自 $id 的消息 #$it&quot;)&#10;        delay(100)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;fun main() = runBlocking {&#10;    val channel = Channel&lt;String&gt;()&#10;&#10;    launch { produceMessages(channel, &quot;传感器A&quot;, 5) }&#10;    launch { produceMessages(channel, &quot;传感器B&quot;, 5) }&#10;&#10;    repeat(10) {&#10;        println(channel.receive())&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>suspend fun produceMessages(channel: SendChannel&#x3C;String>, id: String, count: Int) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    repeat(count) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        channel.send(\"来自 $id 的消息 #$it\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        delay(100)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun main() = runBlocking {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val channel = Channel&#x3C;String>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    launch { produceMessages(channel, \"传感器A\", 5) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    launch { produceMessages(channel, \"传感器B\", 5) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    repeat(10) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println(channel.receive())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    S1[传感器 A] --&gt; CH[Channel]&#10;    S2[传感器 B] --&gt; CH&#10;    CH --&gt; C[Consumer]\">flowchart LR\n    S1[传感器 A] --&gt; CH[Channel]\n    S2[传感器 B] --&gt; CH\n    CH --&gt; C[Consumer]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"管道-pipeline\">管道（Pipeline）</h2><p>通道可以串联形成处理管道：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"fun CoroutineScope.produceInts(): ReceiveChannel&lt;Int&gt; = produce {&#10;    var x = 1&#10;    while (true) send(x++)&#10;}&#10;&#10;fun CoroutineScope.square(input: ReceiveChannel&lt;Int&gt;): ReceiveChannel&lt;Int&gt; = produce {&#10;    for (x in input) send(x * x)&#10;}&#10;&#10;fun CoroutineScope.filter(input: ReceiveChannel&lt;Int&gt;, predicate: (Int) -&gt; Boolean): ReceiveChannel&lt;Int&gt; = produce {&#10;    for (x in input) {&#10;        if (predicate(x)) send(x)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;fun main() = runBlocking {&#10;    val numbers = produceInts()&#10;    val squares = square(numbers)&#10;    val filtered = filter(squares) { it &lt; 100 }&#10;&#10;    for (value in filtered) {&#10;        println(value) // 1, 4, 9, 16, 25, 36, 49, 64, 81&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    coroutineContext.cancelChildren()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fun CoroutineScope.produceInts(): ReceiveChannel&#x3C;Int> = produce {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    var x = 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    while (true) send(x++)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun CoroutineScope.square(input: ReceiveChannel&#x3C;Int>): ReceiveChannel&#x3C;Int> = produce {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for (x in input) send(x * x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun CoroutineScope.filter(input: ReceiveChannel&#x3C;Int>, predicate: (Int) -> Boolean): ReceiveChannel&#x3C;Int> = produce {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for (x in input) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (predicate(x)) send(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun main() = runBlocking {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val numbers = produceInts()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val squares = square(numbers)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val filtered = filter(squares) { it &#x3C; 100 }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for (value in filtered) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println(value) // 1, 4, 9, 16, 25, 36, 49, 64, 81</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    coroutineContext.cancelChildren()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"select-表达式\">select 表达式</h2><p><code>select</code> 可以同时等待多个通道的操作，哪个先就绪就执行哪个：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"import kotlinx.coroutines.selects.select&#10;&#10;suspend fun selectDemo() = coroutineScope {&#10;    val fast = produce {&#10;        delay(100)&#10;        send(&quot;快速结果&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    val slow = produce {&#10;        delay(500)&#10;        send(&quot;慢速结果&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    val result = select {&#10;        fast.onReceive { &quot;从快通道收到: $it&quot; }&#10;        slow.onReceive { &quot;从慢通道收到: $it&quot; }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    println(result) // 从快通道收到: 快速结果&#10;    coroutineContext.cancelChildren()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import kotlinx.coroutines.selects.select</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>suspend fun selectDemo() = coroutineScope {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val fast = produce {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        delay(100)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        send(\"快速结果\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val slow = produce {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        delay(500)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        send(\"慢速结果\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val result = select {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        fast.onReceive { \"从快通道收到: $it\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        slow.onReceive { \"从慢通道收到: $it\" }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println(result) // 从快通道收到: 快速结果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    coroutineContext.cancelChildren()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>select 子句</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>channel.onReceive { }</code></td>\n<td>通道有数据时触发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>channel.onReceiveCatching { }</code></td>\n<td>通道有数据或关闭时触发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>channel.onSend(value) { }</code></td>\n<td>通道可发送时触发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>deferred.onAwait { }</code></td>\n<td>Deferred 完成时触发</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"channel-vs-flow\">Channel vs Flow</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Channel</th>\n<th>Flow</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>模型</td>\n<td>热的（创建即执行）</td>\n<td>冷的（收集时执行）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多消费者</td>\n<td>每条数据只消费一次</td>\n<td>每个收集者独立收到所有数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>背压</td>\n<td>通过缓冲策略</td>\n<td>通过 buffer/conflate</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型用途</td>\n<td>协程间通信</td>\n<td>数据流/响应式流</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Channel</strong> 是协程间安全传递数据的核心原语，以挂起代替阻塞</li>\n<li>四种缓冲策略：<strong>Rendezvous</strong>（无缓冲）、<strong>Buffered</strong>（固定缓冲）、<strong>Conflated</strong>（保留最新）、<strong>Unlimited</strong>（无限缓冲）</li>\n<li><strong>produce</strong> 构建器简化了生产者协程的创建和资源管理</li>\n<li><strong>Fan-Out</strong> 实现多消费者负载均衡，<strong>Fan-In</strong> 实现多生产者汇聚</li>\n<li><strong>管道模式</strong>通过串联通道构建数据处理流水线</li>\n<li><strong>select</strong> 表达式支持同时等待多个通道操作</li>\n<li>Channel 是热的，适合协程间通信；Flow 是冷的，适合数据流场景</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"通道","id":"通道"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Channel 基础","id":"channel-基础"},{"level":2,"text":"Channel 类型","id":"channel-类型"},{"level":2,"text":"produce 构建器","id":"produce-构建器"},{"level":2,"text":"Fan-Out（扇出）","id":"fan-out-扇出"},{"level":2,"text":"Fan-In（扇入）","id":"fan-in-扇入"},{"level":2,"text":"管道（Pipeline）","id":"管道-pipeline"},{"level":2,"text":"select 表达式","id":"select-表达式"},{"level":2,"text":"Channel vs Flow","id":"channel-vs-flow"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"协程上下文","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/coroutines/coroutine-context"},"next":{"title":"Flow 操作符","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/coroutines/flow-operators"}}